### Create Review
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/restaurants/{{RESTAURANT_ID}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

{
  "rating": 3,
  "content": "Average experience.",
  "photoIds": ["{{PHOTO_URL}}"]
}

### Get reviews with default pagination (page=0, size=20, sort by datePosted DESC)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/restaurants/{{RESTAURANT_ID}}/reviews

### Get reviews with custom pagination
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/restaurants/{{RESTAURANT_ID}}/reviews?page=0&size=10&sort=datePosted,desc

### Get reviews with multiple sort criteria
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/restaurants/{{RESTAURANT_ID}}/reviews?page=1&size=5&sort=rating,desc&sort=datePosted,asc

### Get reviews sorted by rating (ascending)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/restaurants/{{RESTAURANT_ID}}/reviews?sort=rating,asc